API Endpoints

Sessions
POST /v1/sessions - Create session
GET /v1/sessions/:session_id - Get session
PATCH /v1/sessions/:session_id - Update session
Transcripts
POST /v1/transcripts - Create transcript
GET /v1/transcripts/:transcript_id - Get transcript
Assessments
POST /v1/assessments/cultural-identity
POST /v1/assessments/progress-perfection
POST /v1/assessments/identity-strength-maturity
POST /v1/assessments/executive-functioning
POST /v1/assessments/capability-accommodation
POST /v1/assessments/intentional-living
Prompts
POST /v1/intentional-action/prompts - Create secular prompt
POST /v1/intentional-action/prompts/faith - Create faith prompt
GET /v1/intentional-action/prompts - Search prompts
Plans
POST /v1/plans/action - Create action plan
GET /v1/plans/:plan_id - Get plan
PATCH /v1/plans/:plan_id - Update plan
Summaries
POST /v1/summaries/session-reflection - Create summary
GET /v1/summaries/:summary_id - Get summary
Reviews
GET /v1/reviews/queue - Get review queue
POST /v1/reviews/:review_id/decision - Submit decision
Events
GET /v1/events - List events
POST /v1/events - Create event
Chat
POST /v1/chats - Create chat
GET /v1/chats/:chat_id - Get chat
GET /v1/chats/:chat_id/messages - Get messages
POST /v1/chats/:chat_id/messages - Send message
PATCH /v1/chats/:chat_id/read - Mark as read
POST /v1/chats/:chat_id/flag - Flag message
POST /v1/chats/:chat_id/escalate - Escalate to coach
